{"id": 63011, "date": "2025-12-16T04:00:22", "date_gmt": "2025-12-16T12:00:22", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63011"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T21:09:47", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T04:09:47", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-16-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/16/kingdom-of-days-december-16-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 16"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1973:\u00a0</strong>Bruce cancels a scheduled show in Willimantic, Connecticut only a day or two before the show.</p>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band bring the now red-hot Born to Run Tour to the State University of New York in Oswego.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sRQcszLVROs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23347\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-12-16/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?fit=1333%2C626&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1333,626\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-12-16\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?fit=758%2C356&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23347 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?resize=758%2C356&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"356\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?w=1333&amp;ssl=1 1333w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?resize=300%2C141&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?resize=1024%2C481&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-16.png?resize=768%2C361&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"14736\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/46889989845_109049cab1_o/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/46889989845_109049cab1_o.jpg?fit=992%2C795&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"992,795\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"46889989845_109049cab1_o\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/46889989845_109049cab1_o.jpg?fit=758%2C607&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-14736 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/46889989845_109049cab1_o.jpg?resize=758%2C607&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"607\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/46889989845_109049cab1_o.jpg?w=992&amp;ssl=1 992w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/46889989845_109049cab1_o.jpg?resize=300%2C240&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/46889989845_109049cab1_o.jpg?resize=768%2C615&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1978:\u00a0</strong>Less famous than its Night One counterpart, Bruce&#8217;s second Darkness show at the Winterland Ballroom in San Francisco is still a great show. &#8220;Rendezvous&#8221; makes its tour premiere early in the set (dedicated to Greg Kihn, who scored a minor hit with his cover), and &#8220;Fire&#8221; will eventually be officially released in <em>Live 1975-85</em>. This show is available as part of Bruce&#8217;s official archive series.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YX4hAJEQ3Co?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>1980:\u00a0</strong>At Night Two at the Boston Garden on the original River Tour, Bruce tour premieres &#8220;Spirit in the Night&#8221; and plays &#8220;Crush on You&#8221; for the last time for 28 years.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PA-dLR83MhI?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>1984:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band start their last Born in the U.S.A. stand of the year at The Omni in Atlanta, where Little Steven guest stars for the entire encore set.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AJ5y99Cucz4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23349\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1984-12-16/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?fit=2593%2C1500&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2593,1500\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1984-12-16\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?fit=758%2C438&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23349 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?resize=758%2C438&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"438\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?w=2593&amp;ssl=1 2593w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?resize=300%2C174&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?resize=1024%2C592&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?resize=768%2C444&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?resize=1536%2C889&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?resize=2048%2C1185&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1984-12-16.png?w=2274&amp;ssl=1 2274w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1992:\u00a0</strong>Joe Grushecky joins Bruce and his new touring band for &#8220;Glory Days&#8217; and &#8220;Santa Claus is Comin&#8217; to Town&#8221; when World Tour 1992 stops at Pittsburgh&#8217;s Civic Arena.</p>\n<div id=\"v-DzFye1yV-1\" class=\"video-player\"><div id='v-DzFye1yV'></div></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23350\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1992-12-16/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?fit=2077%2C814&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2077,814\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1992-12-16\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?fit=758%2C297&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23350 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?resize=758%2C297&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"297\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?w=2077&amp;ssl=1 2077w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?resize=300%2C118&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?resize=1024%2C401&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?resize=768%2C301&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?resize=1536%2C602&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1992-12-16.png?resize=2048%2C803&amp;ssl=1 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"14737\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o.jpg?fit=988%2C765&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"988,765\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"45085203155_e0e88b3926_o\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o.jpg?fit=758%2C587&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-14737 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o.jpg?resize=758%2C587&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"587\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o.jpg?w=988&amp;ssl=1 988w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o.jpg?resize=300%2C232&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/45085203155_e0e88b3926_o.jpg?resize=768%2C595&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1995:\u00a0</strong>At Night Two at the Orpheum Theater in Boston on the Ghost of Tom Joad Tour, Bruce plays &#8220;Brothers Under the Bridge&#8221; for the first time ever, as well as the tour premiere of &#8220;The Promised Land,&#8221; which will evolve as the tour goes on and become a staple of Bruce&#8217;s acoustic performances.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mdNEGaautJw?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fTbt94xmkIY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23351\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1995-12-16/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?fit=2074%2C1147&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2074,1147\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1995-12-16\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?fit=758%2C419&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23351 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?resize=758%2C419&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"419\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?w=2074&amp;ssl=1 2074w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?resize=300%2C166&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?resize=1024%2C566&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?resize=768%2C425&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?resize=1536%2C849&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1995-12-16.png?resize=2048%2C1133&amp;ssl=1 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1997:\u00a0</strong>Bruce throws a Christmas party at McLoone&#8217;s Rum Runner in Sea Bright and joins Bobby Bandiera as the evening&#8217;s entertainment.</p>\n<p><strong>2002:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band bring the Rising Tour to the Value City Arena in Columbus, where Bruce plays a gorgeous solo piano &#8220;If I Should Fall Behind&#8221; and a &#8220;Glory Days&#8221;/&#8221;Hang on Sloopy&#8221; mash-up.</p>\n<div id=\"v-Kr7eHWGX-1\" class=\"video-player\"><div id='v-Kr7eHWGX'></div></div>\n<div id=\"v-44CBegiw-1\" class=\"video-player\"><div id='v-44CBegiw'></div></div>\n<p><strong>2008:</strong>\u00a0Bruce releases &#8220;The Wrestler,&#8221; the third single from his upcoming album, <em>Working on a Dream.</em></p>\n<div id=\"v-mOPjCZv9-1\" class=\"video-player\"><div id='v-mOPjCZv9'></div></div>\n<p><strong>2017:\u00a0</strong><em>Springsteen on Broadway</em> continues its theatrical run at the Walter Kerr Theater in New York City. In attendance tonight: actress Laura Dern.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"5993\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/38396652234_029c0a474d_o/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/38396652234_029c0a474d_o.jpg?fit=587%2C577&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"587,577\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1513503398&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"38396652234_029c0a474d_o\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/38396652234_029c0a474d_o.jpg?fit=587%2C577&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-5993 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/38396652234_029c0a474d_o.jpg?resize=587%2C577&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"577\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/38396652234_029c0a474d_o.jpg?w=587&amp;ssl=1 587w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/38396652234_029c0a474d_o.jpg?resize=300%2C295&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/38396652234_029c0a474d_o.jpg?resize=50%2C50&amp;ssl=1 50w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 587px) 100vw, 587px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>2018:\u00a0</strong>At the stroke of midnight, Netflix starts the day by releasing the streaming video version of\u00a0<em>Springsteen on Broadway.</em></p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M1xDzgob1JI?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2020:\u00a0</strong>E Street Radio premieres Volume 16 of Bruce&#8217;s\u00a0<em>From My Home to Yours\u00a0</em>radio show, entitled &#8220;Hits of the Week.&#8221;</p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-63011-6\" preload=\